<title>HONG KONG: Schroders Asia sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Schroders Asia sets HK$500 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by arranger Schroders Asia.</p>
<p>BORROWER  SCHRODERS ASIA</p>
<p> AMOUNT    HK$500 MLN  COUPON     3MH+50   MATURITY  5 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE	FRCD	  ISS PRICE  PAR	LAUNCHED  MARCH 97</p>
<p> PUTS	YR 3 &amp; 4    CALLS	YR 3 &amp; 4 REPLIES   EARLY APRIL</p>
<p> LISTING   NONE	  REPAYMENT  BULLET   DENOMS    --</p>
<p> RATING    NONE	  SALE LMTS  STANDARD TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> NEG PLG   NONE	  CRS DEF    NONE     FORCE MAJ YES</p>
<p> HOME CTRY UK/HK*	GOV LAW    HK	 PAY DATE  24.APR.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     SENIOR MANAGERS  HK$50 MLN  45 BP   ALL-IN 65 BP</p>
<p>			MANAGERS  HK$25 MLN  30 BP   ALL-IN 60 BP</p>
<p> NOTE	HOLDERS CAN PUT THE ISSUE IF SCHRODERS PLC,</p>
<p>	     WHICH IS RATED A2 BY MOODY'S, CEASES TO OWN</p>
<p>	     BENEFICIALLY MORE THAN 50 PERCENT OF THE ISSUED SHARE</p>
<p>	     CAPITAL OF SCHRODERS ASIA.</p>
<p>ARRANGER  SCHRODERS ASIA</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
